    IF NOT (`Art 2 Chapter I has begun to apply on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapters I and II "shall apply from 2 February 2025" (Art 113(a))
    ELSE IF `the party is a deployer who is a natural person` AND `it uses AI systems in the course of a purely personal non-professional activity`
         THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This Regulation does not apply to obligations of deployers who are natural persons using AI systems in the course of a purely personal non-professional activity"
